+d)\\\\&=\\frac{5}{9}h+\\frac{4}{9}d.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "a231e8f7-c831-5d8c-bda5-919c3fbc6e51" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "a231e8f7-c831-5d8c-bda5-919c3fbc6e51" :question/answer-fields "09b26fff-3c60-5b0c-a922-308e1681e07c"] [:db/ensure "a231e8f7-c831-5d8c-bda5-919c3fbc6e51" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096653 :knowledge-point/questions "a231e8f7-c831-5d8c-bda5-919c3fbc6e51"] [:db/add "50090c19-2a63-59cc-a695-2da66c09cc17" :answer/id #uuid "50090c19-2a63-59cc-a695-2da66c09cc17"] [:db/add "50090c19-2a63-59cc-a695-2da66c09cc17" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "50090c19-2a63-59cc-a695-2da66c09cc17" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}"] [:db/ensure "50090c19-2a63-59cc-a695-2da66c09cc17" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5e949f88-962b-5078-b4a1-f518d948e1ef" :answer-field/id #uuid "5e949f88-962b-5078-b4a1-f518d948e1ef"] [:db/add "5e949f88-962b-5078-b4a1-f518d948e1ef" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "5e949f88-962b-5078-b4a1-f518d948e1ef" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "5e949f88-962b-5078-b4a1-f518d948e1ef" :answer-field/choices "50090c19-2a63-59cc-a695-2da66c09cc17"] [:db/add "5e949f88-962b-5078-b4a1-f518d948e1ef" :answer-field/correct "50090c19-2a63-59cc-a695-2da66c09cc17"] [:db/ensure "5e949f88-962b-5078-b4a1-f518d948e1ef" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f63a8733-1610-56a6-8aba-855f38add454" :answer/id #uuid "f63a8733-1610-56a6-8aba-855f38add454"] [:db/add "f63a8733-1610-56a6-8aba-855f38add454" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f63a8733-1610-56a6-8aba-855f38add454" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}"] [:db/ensure "f63a8733-1610-56a6-8aba-855f38add454" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9a05d223-9c7f-517d-8b75-5df4dc2ef5ec" :answer-field/id #uuid "9a05d223-9c7f-517d-8b75-5df4dc2ef5ec"] [:db/add "9a05d223-9c7f-517d-8b75-5df4dc2ef5ec" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "9a05d223-9c7f-517d-8b75-5df4dc2ef5ec" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "9a05d223-9c7f-517d-8b75-5df4dc2ef5ec" :answer-field/choices "f63a8733-1610-56a6-8aba-855f38add454"] [:db/add "9a05d223-9c7f-517d-8b75-5df4dc2ef5ec" :answer-field/correct "f63a8733-1610-56a6-8aba-855f38add454"] [:db/ensure "9a05d223-9c7f-517d-8b75-5df4dc2ef5ec" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "2bdedb9a-7e8c-5c79-b07b-563ec35e60d2" :question/id #uuid "2bdedb9a-7e8c-5c79-b07b-563ec35e60d2"] [:db/add "2bdedb9a-7e8c-5c79-b07b-563ec35e60d2" :question/problem "![](images/bb/bbfd8f27e48a2cab67475cb4a6175001b93348f885a882022ec79cb733771e6d.png)\n\nIn the diagram, $P$ lies on the segment $HR$. The given vectors are $\\overrightarrow{OH}=r$ and $\\overrightarrow{OR}=a$. The lengths satisfy $HP:PR=1:1$.\n\nExpress $\\overrightarrow{OP}$ in terms of $r$ and $a$. Fill in both coefficients, including their signs.\n\n$\\overrightarrow{OP}=$ {{field-1}} $r+$ {{field-2}} $a$"] [:db/add "2bdedb9a-7e8c-5c79-b07b-563ec35e60d2" :question/worked-solution "First express both endpoint vectors in the directions away from $O$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{OH}=r\\qquad \\overrightarrow{OR}=a .\n$$\n\nTrace the path from $H$ through $O$ to $R$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{HR}=\\overrightarrow{HO}+\\overrightarrow{OR}=-r+a.\n$$\n\nThe ratio $HP:PR=1:1$ gives $2$ parts in the whole segment. Thus\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{HP}=\\frac{1}{2}\\overrightarrow{HR}=\\frac{1}{2}(-r+a).\n$$\n\nAdd along the path $O\\to H\\to P$ and collect coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overrightarrow{OP}&=\\overrightarrow{OH}+\\overrightarrow{HP}\\\\&=r+\\frac{1}{2}(-r+a)\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}r+\\frac{1}{2}a.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "2bdedb9a-7e8c-5c79-b07b-563ec35e60d2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "2bdedb9a-7e8c-5c79-b07b-563ec35e60d2" :question/answer-fields "5e949f88-962b-5078-b4a1-f518d948e1ef"] [:db/add "2bdedb9a-7e8c-5c79-b07b-563ec35e60d2" :question/answer-fields "9a05d223-9c7f-517d-8b75-5df4dc2ef5ec"] [:db/ensure "2bdedb9a-7e8c-5c79-b07b-563ec35e60d2" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096653 :knowledge-point/questions "2bde